<p>Ok, I'll answer the questions you asked and I really appreciate your feedback. So, first, this SCP doesn't target specific people and I only showed the Researcher as one so the Foundation would notice his missing. Ok second, the Researcher sort of enters a pocket dimension, it makes him swap places with the reflection and for that time he is trapped in sort of another dimension, which is one of the reasons why the anomaly doesn't occur when multiple people are witnessing since they shouldn't see the person being teleported there. So anyway, the Researcher didn't exactly die of multiple cuts, he died because by taking the reflection's role he would obviously die if the mirror breaks and the multiple cut wounds only represent that the mirror was shattered into peaces. About it's containment, I'm glad you ask, I think that the SCP's containment would be by having 4 or 5 guards always be securing the area and taking shifts so that the gas station would never move and the guards wouldn't have effect from the mirror. About the other SCP's i'll gladly take a look, thanks for the recommendation, if there's any more questions i'll be happy to answer and I hope these answers satisfy you</p>

